<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-15T17:53:41.069Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:53:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi Prime Minister has dismissed nine officials linked to an oil-smuggling network in the pro-Iran stronghold of Babil and announced a special security force and energy police to protect pipelines. Kataib Hezbollah has rejected the findings of an oil probe in Jurf al-Nasr, accused the prime minister of yielding to US and Gulf pressure, and been given an end-of-week deadline by al-Zaidi to vacate the area, while al-Zaidi has threatened force to assert control over Jurf al-Sakhar. Bahrain has accused Iran of attacking its territory in retaliation for US actions, linking regional tensions to the Iraqi smuggling crackdown. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPNXp6RWxhdzNHd0FkRExUMjE2Q09HRXowa04wTXNjc3JvVlh5UVZUVmZWZUhWcVFoSzgxUkpOcFItN2JGQ2sxMVFYZFFBcFlScW5ySTdIMGtXaFA4VzNsQUR2aU11MzZTQ1NjX2VtaHFZUXZ0cUE3NWhncEV3ckFoc3JzQWhKTElqREF5WlNLdXZTQ3FMamRLcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE56LW9xcWNfRG14YVhVLUMtck5BT2ZYN3AwTmRaNnBzanoyVkhBcGh3MklhamlEMTloclVyRko1UFlIamJ4eS1yX29Zcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNa3ZISnQweG4zWFRWaXVDREtadENyNW1CaDNTandtZWE3a3l1Y1o1X0Nhc3pCWDh5N1h5ZkJuU3lYTi1HOU9ZVDdsWTFiaG1wNWJCNEpVTDBzelo1b1l4TnN6QmVXZF9MUDVDY0JsUHZPUUFNT3ZpSHZEUnhqcEJiOURFTG1HX0JhTUN1N0tfd0JYN1NhYzg0bTJ2Yl9mck9XSFE5NHVfR1hUNjFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;IraqiNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPeUJUalN5azBm